From e4fa2446b81f4c65640126c4e0b0933c0a7d379f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lunatickochiya <125438787@qq.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 14:08:43 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] feat(server): configurable library checksums and rehash
 job

- add library.checksum.external (sha1-path | sha1) and
  library.checksum.dedupeUploadsAgainstLibraries to the admin config
- hash external library imports with the configured algorithm and skip
  duplicate content inside a library, including concurrent import races
- de-duplicate uploads against external library assets on upload,
  checksum preflight and bulk upload checks
- add LibraryRehash job + POST /libraries/recompute-checksums to migrate
  existing assets, skipping unique checksum conflicts
